{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"きのうは個別握手会でした！！\nビックサイト～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/16/9092575/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アウトな制服きました～\n18さい～アウト～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも制服きてたい。まだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nいつぶりだろう！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーフツイン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/16/9092575/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしすぎて辛かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部目は\n首輪っぽい\nチョーカーつけつけました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/16/9092575/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近毎日チョーカーつけてる！ばーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/16/9092575/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/16/9092575/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で！で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前言った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスが似合う女ランキング1位が\nアイス食べていたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは( °_° )写真とんなきゃ( °_° )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなって\n川後有能だしカメラセンスあるんで\nPとして引き出したよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これぜったい\nファンに褒められるやつ～\n飛鳥ふぁん（歓喜）のやつ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚悟してね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきますよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/16/9092575/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/16/9092575/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、\n天使"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで\nみんな瞬殺"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/16/9092575/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/16/9092575/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと褒めて～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてさすが1位のかわいさ\nアイスが最高に似合います優勝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごちそうさまです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/16/9092575/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもって\n本日の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さいとうちはるさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さいとうつながり～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばいね\n大学生になってから\nこの女感ですよ！！！！わーお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女って怖いね。\n年齢によって魅力が変わってくるからね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/16/9092575/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめん\nさいとうつながりの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうりは\nきょうはとれてないけど\nため撮りしてるやつあるから\nまた小出ししてく\\(*ˊᗜˋ*)/"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/16/9092575/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばい川後カメラ有能かよ\n乃木坂公式カメラマン化したほうがいいわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って自分で褒めてみるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうかな、\nこのメンバーを可愛くとるコーナー\n続けようかな、\nみんなの支持しだいでは......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/16/9092575/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勇者川後の川後キックは\n一応黒帯初段もちなので\n痛いよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( °_° )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}